{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/01_technology/02_server/node/kill-node/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Vance’s Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"858aee65-fbaf-5b52-9d12-f81b140f85df","excerpt":"查看端口号的进程 界面显示 此时 PID 是 杀掉进程","html":"<p><strong>查看端口号的进程</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">// 查询5000端口PID\n<span class=\"token function\">lsof</span> -i:5000</code></pre></div>\n<p>界面显示</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">COMMAND  PID     <span class=\"token environment constant\">USER</span>   FD   TYPE             DEVICE SIZE/OFF NODE NAME\n<span class=\"token function\">node</span>    <span class=\"token number\">1842</span> <span class=\"token number\">123</span>   30u  IPv6 ***      0t0  TCP *:commplex-main <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>LISTEN<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>此时 PID 是<code class=\"language-text\">1842</code></p>\n<p><strong>杀掉进程</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">kill</span> -9 <span class=\"token number\">1842</span></code></pre></div>","frontmatter":{"title":"mac 使用命令杀掉 node 服务","date":"2021-07-09","description":"mac 使用命令杀掉 node 服务"},"fields":{"slug":"/01_technology/02_server/node/kill-node/","gitModifiedTime":"2024-02-20 23:24"}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/01_technology/02_server/node/puppeteer-pdf/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"使用 puppeteer 实现 PDF 文件合成"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/01_technology/01_client/c_c++/002_c++ 常用操作/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"c++ 常用操作"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"858aee65-fbaf-5b52-9d12-f81b140f85df","previousPostId":"949f5f98-90d6-5c42-87d5-5a1d93a98a48","nextPostId":"6f80c6ad-d252-5e99-a72a-9dba9d92f1ee"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}